    "description": "Amid Tulum National Park, this refined all-inclusive beachfront hotel with Maya-inspired architecture is 6 km from Highway 307 and 2 km from the Temple of the Frescoes.\nRelaxed suites offer free Wi-Fi, flat-screens, minibars and coffeemakers, plus balconies with garden and/or pool views. Upgraded suites sleep up to 6 guests; some add lounge areas, dining rooms and/or kitchenettes, and whirlpool tubs. Room service is available 24/7.\nThere are 4 restaurants, as well as a cocktail bar and a cafe. Other amenities include a spa, a private beach area, a gym and a kids' club, plus an outdoor pool with a kids' section, a lazy river and a swim-up bar."
